Border': '[0, 0, 0]', '/BS': "{'/W': 0}", '/C': '[0.84, 0.08, 0.1]', '/T': 'Lean 已验证范围（截至 v0.2.2）', '/Contents': '(7.4) Q逐项真实求导，再由邻域兼容和κ≠0证明FD=Q/(2κ)的HasDerivAt恒等式；含开区间入口和非零路径实例。未乘μ、未空间积分；DD未宣称非负。\n\n模块：LeanPML/PML/LocalDebye.lean\n定理命名空间：LeanPML.PML\n声明：polar_rate_algebra; hasDerivAt_polarQuadratic; hasDerivAt_polarEnergy; hasDerivAt_polarEnergy_on_Ioo; hasDerivAt_example_polarEnergy\n证据：Lean_PML/logs/v0.2.2/ 的实际构建和公理审计。', '/F': '4'}]
